69a2\" href=\"?note=6a238253009869a2\" title=\"56-df-normalizing-strategy\">56-df-normalizing-strategy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" href=\"?note=a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-system\">56-df-rewrite-system</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"55c39f44acb2211c\" href=\"?note=55c39f44acb2211c\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-relation\">56-df-rewrite-relation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"1db927c3e4a86c94\" href=\"?note=1db927c3e4a86c94\" title=\"56-df-needed-redex\">56-df-needed-redex</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a68d684938525240\" href=\"?note=a68d684938525240\" title=\"56-df-orthogonal-residual\">56-df-orthogonal-residual</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"4634b959eefaa45b\" href=\"?note=4634b959eefaa45b\" title=\"56-thm-orthogonal-residual-preservation\">56-thm-orthogonal-residual-preservation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"eae7831ebc0a54f0\" href=\"?note=eae7831ebc0a54f0\" title=\"56-thm-needed-strategy-normalizing\">56-thm-needed-strategy-normalizing</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§4.9 Theorem 4.9.19; Definition 4.9.8"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"133,136–137"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>154</span><span>157</span><span>158</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"source-locator-retained-from-supplied-text; local-needed-proof-chain"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\">\\(\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\">\\(T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)\\)</span> 和规则集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" href=\"?note=a6c29a8d098ef0ed\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-system\">56-df-rewrite-system</a>；这里 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,V\">\\(F,V\\)</span> 分别实例化上游的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F,\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to_R\">\\(\\to_R\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"55c39f44acb2211c\" href=\"?note=55c39f44acb2211c\" title=\"56-df-rewrite-relation\">56-df-rewrite-relation</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"34fb9d07dfbad48c\" href=\"?note=34fb9d07dfbad48c\" title=\"56-df-orthogonal\">56-df-orthogonal</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LeftNormal}(\\Sigma,V,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{LeftNormal}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"c16c3dd943e2288c\" href=\"?note=c16c3dd943e2288c\" title=\"56-df-left-normal\">56-df-left-normal</a>，它含正交性；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NO}_{\\Sigma,V,R}\">\\(\\mathrm{NO}_{\\Sigma,V,R}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"2ebc9e1638fe6861\" href=\"?note=2ebc9e1638fe6861\" title=\"56-df-normal-order\">56-df-normal-order</a>，正规化策略见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-16\" data-note=\"6a238253009869a2\" href=\"?note=6a238253009869a2\" title=\"56-df-normalizing-strategy\">56-df-normalizing-strategy</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Red}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{Red}_R\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Needed}_R\">\\(\\operatorname{Needed}_R\\)</span> 和具体步、有限路径、残余传送采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-17\" data-note=\"1db927c3e4a86c94\" href=\"?note=1db927c3e4a86c94\" title=\"56-df-needed-redex\">56-df-needed-redex</a> 的接口；位置序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}\">\\(&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}\\)</span> 沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-18\" data-note=\"2ebc9e1638fe6861\" href=\"?note=2ebc9e1638fe6861\" title=\"56-df-normal-order\">56-df-normal-order</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in T\">\\(s\\in T\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\">\\(u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\\)</span> 在第一条断言中有界量化。</li>\n<li>单步残余与正交保持性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-19\" data-note=\"a68d684938525240\" href=\"?note=a68d684938525240\" title=\"56-df-orthogonal-residual\">56-df-orthogonal-residual</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-20\" data-note=\"4634b959eefaa45b\" href=\"?note=4634b959eefaa45b\" title=\"56-thm-orthogonal-residual-preservation\">56-thm-orthogonal-residual-preservation</a>；必需归约的正规化结论见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-21\" data-note=\"eae7831ebc0a54f0\" href=\"?note=eae7831ebc0a54f0\" title=\"56-thm-needed-strategy-normalizing\">56-thm-needed-strategy-normalizing</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall s\\in T\\;\\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{LeftNormal}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\land\n\\forall v\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\\;\n\\neg(\\operatorname{pos}(v)&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}\\operatorname{pos}(u))\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{Needed}_R(s,u)\n\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall s\\in T\\;\\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{LeftNormal}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\land\n\\forall v\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\\;\n\\neg(\\operatorname{pos}(v)&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}\\operatorname{pos}(u))\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{Needed}_R(s,u)\n\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LeftNormal}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{NormalizingStrategy}(T,\\to_R,\\mathrm{NO}_{\\Sigma,V,R}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{LeftNormal}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{NormalizingStrategy}(T,\\to_R,\\mathrm{NO}_{\\Sigma,V,R}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>第一式补齐最左最外选择与本目录needed正规化之间的桥，以下论证只用本书内部已经给出的左正规性、正交残余和needed定义。</p>\n<p>设初始红项 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 的位置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 在全部红项位置中最小。考虑尚未收缩 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 的另一步，其位置为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span>。正交性使同位置的规则身份唯一，故这一步不是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 就有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}q\">\\(p&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}q\\)</span>。它只能位于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 内部或其右侧不交位置，残余公式给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 的单个同位置残余。</p>\n<p>还须证明该步不能在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 之前新建红项。假设目标项在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}p\">\\(r&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}p\\)</span> 有红项，左项为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>。如果 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 不在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 子树内，该红项在源项已存在，与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 最小矛盾。因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 的严格前缀。在目标项中，位置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 的红项不能落在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 的非变量模式中，否则构成非根重叠；所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 落在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 的某个变量出现 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\">\\(b\\)</span> 的实例内。左正规性保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> 的每个非变量位置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span> 都满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}b\">\\(c&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}b\\)</span>，从而 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\cdot c&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}r\\cdot b\\preceq p&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}q\">\\(r\\cdot c&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}r\\cdot b\\preceq p&lt;_{\\mathrm{lex}}q\\)</span>。收缩 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\">\\(q\\)</span> 不改变这些非变量位置的符号。左线性使匹配只要求这些非变量符号及树形相符，不另要求两个变量实例相等；因此源项在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 已匹配 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>，又与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 最小矛盾。</p>\n<p>对未收缩该残余的路径长度归纳，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 始终是同位置的最左红项。通向正规形的路径不能一直保留它，故必收缩它的某个残余；这正是第一式。没有正规形时needed定义本来就真空成立。</p>\n<p>NO在每个非正规形选择上述唯一的具体收缩，在正规形保持恒等。若从一个可正规化起点迭代NO却永不到达正规形，这些唯一具体步组成无限needed归约，违反 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-22\" data-note=\"eae7831ebc0a54f0\" href=\"?note=eae7831ebc0a54f0\" title=\"56-thm-needed-strategy-normalizing\">56-thm-needed-strategy-normalizing</a>。于是得到原有的正规化策略断言。此证明不再依赖未附带的标准化定理文本，保留原定理的左正规与正交条件；也不增加可计算性断言。</p>\n<p>原有章节及页码作为输入文本的出处定位保留；本次补齐的是上述内部数学推导，不声称重新读取或核验了外部DjVu及历史检查材料。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-left-normal","status":"resolved","id":"c16c3dd943e2288c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-left-normal]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-orthogonal","status":"resolved","id":"34fb9d07dfbad48c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-orthogonal]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-normal-order","status":"resolved","id":"2ebc9e1638fe6861","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":""