operatorname{Red}_R(s)$ 在第一条断言中有界量化。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-normal-order","status":"resolved","id":"2ebc9e1638fe6861","anchor":"ref-18","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Red}_R$、$\\operatorname{Needed}_R$ 和具体步、有限路径、残余传送采用 [[56-df-needed-redex]] 的接口；位置序 $<_{\\mathrm{lex}}$ 沿用 [[56-df-normal-order]]。$s\\in T$ 和 $u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)$ 在第一条断言中有界量化。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-orthogonal-residual","status":"resolved","id":"a68d684938525240","anchor":"ref-19","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"单步残余与正交保持性见 [[56-df-orthogonal-residual]]、[[56-thm-orthogonal-residual-preservation]]；必需归约的正规化结论见 [[56-thm-needed-strategy-normalizing]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-orthogonal-residual-preservation","status":"resolved","id":"4634b959eefaa45b","anchor":"ref-20","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"单步残余与正交保持性见 [[56-df-orthogonal-residual]]、[[56-thm-orthogonal-residual-preservation]]；必需归约的正规化结论见 [[56-thm-needed-strategy-normalizing]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-needed-strategy-normalizing","status":"resolved","id":"eae7831ebc0a54f0","anchor":"ref-21","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"单步残余与正交保持性见 [[56-df-orthogonal-residual]]、[[56-thm-orthogonal-residual-preservation]]；必需归约的正规化结论见 [[56-thm-needed-strategy-normalizing]]。","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-needed-strategy-normalizing","status":"resolved","id":"eae7831ebc0a54f0","anchor":"ref-22","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"NO在每个非正规形选择上述唯一的具体收缩，在正规形保持恒等。若从一个可正规化起点迭代NO却永不到达正规形，这些唯一具体步组成无限needed归约，违反 [[56-thm-needed-strategy-normalizing]]。于是得到原有的正规化策略断言。此证明不再依赖未附带的标准化定理文本，保留原定理的左正规与正交条件；也不增加可计算性断言。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(F,\\mathrm{ar})","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,V)","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TRS}(\\Sigma,V,R)","display":false},{"tex":"F,V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal F,\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\to_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LeftNormal}(\\Sigma,V,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NO}_{\\Sigma,V,R}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Red}_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Needed}_R","display":false},{"tex":"<_{\\mathrm{lex}}","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall s\\in T\\;\\forall u\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\\;\n\\Bigl(\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{LeftNormal}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\land\n\\forall v\\in\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\\;\n\\neg(\\operatorname{pos}(v)<_{\\mathrm{lex}}\\operatorname{pos}(u))\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{Needed}_R(s,u)\n\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LeftNormal}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\Longrightarrow\n\\mathrm{NormalizingStrategy}(T,\\to_R,\\mathrm{NO}_{\\Sigma,V,R}).","display":true},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"p<_{\\mathrm{lex}}q","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"r<_{\\mathrm{lex}}p","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"b","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"c<_{\\mathrm{lex}}b","display":false},{"tex":"r\\cdot c<_{\\mathrm{lex}}r\\cdot b\\preceq p<_{\\mathrm{lex}}q","display":false},{"tex":"q","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"u","display":false}],"bytes":4469,"backlinks":[{